From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: crypto: rockchip: Add the RK3528's crypto engine

The RK3528's crypto engine is the RK3568's second-generation one, with
version registers the vendor's driver reads beside it: describe it with
the RK3568's compatible as its fallback.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/rockchip,rk3588-crypto.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/rockchip,rk3588-crypto.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/rockchip,rk3588-crypto.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/crypto/rockchip,rk3588-crypto.yaml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@
       - const: rockchip,rk3568-crypto
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - rockchip,rk3528-crypto
               - rockchip,rk3588-crypto
           - const: rockchip,rk3568-crypto
 
